Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (\S+)
Value CONPLAT_VERSION (\S+)
Value HARDWARE (.*)
Value UPTIME (.*)
Value SERIAL_NUMBER (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*Software Release\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*Conplat Version is\s+${CONPLAT_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s*${HARDWARE}\s+Uptime is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^\s*Serial Number:\s+${SERIAL_NUMBER}\s*$$ -> Record
